                    {
                        "sense_id": "9b24f570-8714-34f4-8d53-a15ba8e699d4",
                        "entry_id": "304d3bcd-9539-3ea2-8523-86fa0665ac37",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The treatment of disease, especially skin disease, by exposure to ultraviolet light; radiotherapy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7659acca-1c98-4b4e-8aa1-9180831644f4",
                                "sense_id": "9b24f570-8714-34f4-8d53-a15ba8e699d4",
                                "text": "I shall discuss in the following chapter the underlying principles and indications of actinotherapy in each of the diseases enumerated."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee51c627-a110-4ed3-b9da-623dffea1c29",
                                "sense_id": "9b24f570-8714-34f4-8d53-a15ba8e699d4",
                                "text": "The author reports a series of 160 cases of peritoneal and genital tuberculosis in the female, about half of which were treated by actinotherapy and heliotherapy, while the other half were given radiotherapy."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ce9b99f6-dd3a-4a52-9f8d-532516c0a989",
                                "sense_id": "9b24f570-8714-34f4-8d53-a15ba8e699d4",
                                "text": "Apart from tuberculosis and open wounds, the other main indication found for actinotherapy was rickets."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
